            {
              "content": "=Do not modify, label, delete, send, or reply to the email.\n\nAnalyze the email and classify it into exactly ONE category:\n\nIMPORTANT\nJOBS\nPERSONAL\nFINANCE\nEDUCATION\nEVENTS\n\nRules:\n- JOBS: job opportunities, recruiters, interviews, applications, hiring, career alerts, or professional opportunities.\n- FINANCE: banking, payments, transactions, bills, investments, insurance, taxes, financial accounts, or money-related matters.\n- EDUCATION: courses, exams, certifications, colleges, universities, workshops, academic learning, or educational opportunities.\n- EVENTS: invitations, meetings, conferences, webinars, appointments, tickets, or scheduled events.\n- PERSONAL: personal conversations, social messages, shopping/personal services, family, friends, or general non-work correspondence.\n- IMPORTANT: security alerts, account warnings, critical notifications, urgent matters, or emails that require immediate attention and don't clearly belong to another category.\n\nIf an email could fit multiple categories, choose the category that best represents its PRIMARY purpose.\n\nReturn ONLY this format:\n\nCategory: CATEGORY\nReason: one short sentence\n\nEmail content:\n{{ $json.snippet }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
